{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "fdae5e11-0a28-4666-8990-196cde241696",
    "name": "Save For Later",
    "description": "Storefront Save-For-Later (SFL) API reference, extracted from `storefront/docs/SAVE_FOR_LATER_README.md` §2 (\"The entire API change\") and `storefront/src/sdk/api/flits-app-api.js`.\n\n**No endpoint is new.** SFL reuses every wishlist endpoint — the discriminator is the `wishlist_type: \"save_for_later\"` field (no \"d\"; see README §3 \"Two different tokens\"). Omitting it on a read/delete/count silently falls back to the wishlist because the server defaults an unscoped call to `wishlist_type in: [\"wishlist\"]`.\n\nFolders:\n1. Save (cart-line, actions endpoint) — `POST /core/wishlist/actions` via `addToWishlist` → `addToSavedForLater`\n2. Read (items/query) — list + count via `getSavedForLaterData` / `getSavedForLaterCount`\n3. Remove — single (`removeFromSavedForLater`) and bulk (`bulkRemoveFromSavedForLater`)\n4. Guest → Login merge — `bulkCreateSavedForLaterItems`, silent push right after login\n5. Cart integration (Shopify AJAX, unchanged) — cart-line removal via `/cart/change.js`, move-to-cart via `/cart/add.js`\n6. Analytics — `POST /api/storefront/analytics-event`, `page_type: \"save_for_later\"` (no \"d\")\n\nSetup: set `base_url_host`, `merchant_id`, `jwt_token` collection variables. Guest calls use `guest_browser_id` instead of `shopify_customer_id`/`customer_email` (except non-silent guest flows, which still need email).\n\nAuth model: `Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}` + `merchant_id` header on every Flits API call (in production the Shopify App Proxy injects merchant context). The `/cart/*.js` calls are same-origin Shopify AJAX, no auth header.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "27853622"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Save (cart-line, actions endpoint)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Add to Save For Later — cart-line (logged-in)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "merchant_id",
                "value": "{{merchant_id}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "[\n    {\n        \"merchant_id\": \"{{merchant_id}}\",\n        \"operation\": \"create\",\n        \"action\": \"wishlisted\",\n        \"is_guest\": false,\n        \"customer_email\": \"{{customer_email}}\",\n        \"shopify_customer_id\": {{shopify_customer_id}},\n        \"product_id\": 8578576122005,\n        \"variant_id\": 45310633214101,\n        \"product_handle\": \"gift-card\",\n        \"product_title\": \"Gift Card\",\n        \"variant_title\": \"$10\",\n        \"product_image\": \"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0673/3106/3957/files/gift_card.png\",\n        \"price\": 10,\n        \"wishlist_type\": \"save_for_later\",\n        \"page_type\": \"save_for_later\"\n    }\n]",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://{{base_url_host}}/core/wishlist/actions",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url_host}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "core",
                "wishlist",
                "actions"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
